# Seerr Provider

The `seerr` provider enables you to configure, manage, and automate [Overseerr](https://overseerr.dev) and [Jellyseerr](https://github.com/Fallenbagel/jellyseerr) media request and discovery platforms via Infrastructure as Code with OpenTofu and Terraform.

## Features

- **Full Resource & Data Source Coverage**: Manage application settings, users, media, requests, issues, discovery sliders, override rules, and job schedules.
- **Typed Notification Integrations**: First-class support for 11 notification agents (Discord, Email, Gotify, LunaSea, Ntfy, Pushbullet, Pushover, Slack, Telegram, Webhook, Webpush) with live test triggers.
- **Dynamic Servarr Resolvers**: Direct lookups for Radarr and Sonarr quality profiles, root folders, tags, and language profiles.
- **Media Server Integrations**: Plex, Jellyfin, and Emby settings, library synchronization, and user import workflows.
- **Granular Permissions & Quotas**: Bitmask permission sets, user request quotas, and watchlist sync management.
- **Drift Protection & Schema Fidelity**: Double-apply drift protection and generic fallback primitives (`seerr_api_object`, `seerr_api_request`).

